# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5
# Drawn velocities and typed restraints in the Python model on the CPU
# (D198), scenario nvt-double of Inputs/python_velocities_restraints.py.
# NVT runs with drawn velocities and restraints against `mdir run` of the
# same control file in double precision, and the effect of the restraints
# and of their reference.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_velocities_restraints.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide CPU mdir mdir-model-test %t nvt-double | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: NVT: the restraints change the potential
# CHECK: velocities and restraints nvt-double passed
